flowchart TB
  USER[Lucas / Project Owner] --> ENTRY[AI-first Entry + Executor Adapter]
  ENTRY --> MASTER[Master Agent - Management and Coordination]
  MASTER --> ARCH[Architecture Pillar - Specialist Agents]
  MASTER --> ENG[Engineering Pillar - Specialist Agents]
  MASTER --> BACKLOG[Backlog Management Pillar - Specialist Agents]
  MASTER --> DEV[Development Pillar - Specialists, TDD, QA, Review, E2E]
  ARCH --> BASELINE[Approved Architecture Baseline]
  ENG --> DESIGNS[Technical Contracts and Designs]
  BACKLOG --> SCOPE[Epics, Features, Stories, Tasks]
  DEV --> HOMOLOG[Homologation Readiness]
  HOMOLOG --> GMUD[Optional Post-Homologation GMUD]
  GMUD -. Outside Harness .-> PROD[Production Deployment]
  MASTER <--> PIPE[Dynamic Pipeline Definitions and Run Snapshots]
  MASTER <--> STATE[Canonical Project Artifacts, Events, Handoffs]
  MASTER <--> CTX[Bounded Context Assembly]
  CTX <--> CG[CodeGraph: Code Structure]
  CTX <--> GF[Graphify: Cross-Artifact Relations]
  CTX <--> KNOW[Curated Skills and External Knowledge]
  MASTER --> TOOLS[Bounded Deterministic Tools]
  MASTER -. Optional .-> MEMORY[ai-memory]
  MASTER -. Optional .-> OBS[OpenTelemetry / Phoenix]
  MASTER -. Optional .-> MODEL[Direct Model / Optional OmniRoute]
  LUCAS[Lucas Approval] -. Architecture Reopen .-> ARCH
